{'symbol': 'F', 'date': '2022-11-30 07:00:00', 'title': 'FORD BUILDS 150,000TH MUSTANG MACH-E; AVAILABLE IN 37 COUNTRIES FOR 2023 WITH PLANS TO ADD MORE SOON', 'text': 'DEARBORN, MICH.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--FORD HAS PRODUCED ITS 150,000TH MUSTANG MACH-E SINCE STARTING PRODUCTION NEARLY TWO YEARS AGO, A SIGNIFICANT MILESTONE AS THE COMPANY SCALES EV PRODUCTION TO A RATE OF 600,000 ANNUALLY BY LATE 2023 AND MORE THAN 2 MILLION ANNUALLY BY 2026.'}